# #5866 B2 (a5e2e2ef, #5866 comments 6667971108 and 6668005024): the donor's bound on a
# sibling's marker resolves only on a witness of that sibling's own link (LinkedGeneration,
# written after its link's raise succeeded), never on a raise of the shard's routing generation,
# which L1 makes for any link in the shard (HandOffMarkerCore.CollectPendingDonorBounds).
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestLinkWitnessWithoutOwnRaise
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
PERTURBS: LinkWitness
SUMMARY: the link witness is recorded without L's own link's raise (a failed raise after the link was recorded), so L's bound resolves while the stale donor's route is unfenced and L free-advances past its write
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE, WithOtherLinkRaise = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ moved
    /\ ~lw
    /\ lw' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the witness does not wait for L's own link and raise.
    /\ ~lw
    /\ lw' = TRUE
--- END
